"dengan ID bootloader/DFU baru (misalnya 37C5:1202/9202 M4, 1203/9203 M7, "
"1204/9204 H7, 124A/924A H7 Plus, 1205/9205), memberi label papan 1209:ABD1 "
"lama sebagai Legacy sambil tetap mendukung firmware lama dan baru (\\ "
"`6d78d6571 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6d78d6571>`__\\ , "
"`6a6a9351d <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/6a6a9351d>`__\\ , "
"`500b1a0bf <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/500b1a0bf>`__\\ )."

